  "summary": {
    "en": {
      "caveats": null,
      "what": "This technical perspective synthesizes the role of urban green infrastructure in enhancing human wellbeing, focusing on its ecological, social, and psychological benefits. It outlines design principles and implementation strategies for integrating green spaces into rapidly urbanizing environments.",
      "why": "It establishes a conceptual framework that moves green infrastructure from an aesthetic luxury to a core component of urban health and planning policy."
